              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Osmosis is a patience or solitaire card game using 52-card standard pack, with layout management as the central puzzle. It is also known as Treasure Trove and builds foundations by availability rather than strict numerical order."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Osmosis is documented as a distinct patience game with a named layout and rule structure. The record is separate because the source describes a playable solitaire rather than only a variant note."
